\fBFull Changelog\fP
.SS v1.3.7 (8 November 2024)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Test against Python 3.13.
.IP \(bu 2
Update the Makefile to support Semantic Versioning from git tags.
.IP \(bu 2
Update the C libraries to allow for passing the version as a compiler
flag.
.IP \(bu 2
Update \fBsetup.py\fP to pass the SCM version to the Cython compiler.
.IP \(bu 2
Include C tests in the Tox suite (for linux and macos only).
.IP \(bu 2
Document any and all changes to the C API since forking.
.IP \(bu 2
Restructure changelog documentation.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.3.6 (7 October 2024)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix wrong int type in Windows
(#2 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:PJ-Watson/\:sep-pjw/\:issues/2>, thanks to
@acenko for pointing this out).
.IP \(bu 2
Update tests to run on multiple operating systems.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.3.5 (12 June 2024)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Small fixes and updates to ensure compatibility with NumPy 2.0.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.3.4 (21 February 2024)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Include .clang\-format as a pre\-commit hook, to ensure consistent code
style (improved readability, easier maintenance).
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed \fBmake test\fP to account for the changes in
v1.3.0 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:PJ-Watson/\:sep-pjw/\:releases/\:tag/\:v1\:.3.0>\&.
.IP \(bu 2
All header files include the correct definitions.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.3.3 (7 February 2024)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Add changelog to documentation.
.IP \(bu 2
Add tests for re\-running with seg map.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix array boundary bugs when re\-running with seg map.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug with precision loss when calculating threshold.
.IP \(bu 2
Improve error handling when object pixels exceed pix stack.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.3.2 (5 February 2024)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Move documentation to new location, fix package names and imports.
.IP \(bu 2
Add wheels for Python 3.11/3.12.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix C compilation errors on windows (VLAs).
.IP \(bu 2
Publish updated version to PyPI under new name.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.3.1 (31 January 2024)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Formatting changes (follow black \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:psf/\:black>
formatting style).
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBbench.py\fP and \fBtest.py\fP, removing deprecated functions.
.IP \(bu 2
Move metadata into \fBpyproject.toml\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Add pre\-commit hooks for code and docstring validation.
.IP \(bu 2
Change to dynamic versioning (git tag/commit based).
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.3.0 (1 December 2023)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBsegmentation_map\fP argument of \fBsep.extract()\fP will now accept
either an array or boolean. If an existing segmentation map is passed,
the object detection stage is skipped, and sources will be individually
analysed according to the provided map. This change is
backwards\-compatible with respect to the Python module.
.sp
Please note that as no deblending is performed, the calculated
thresholds (and any dependent parameters) may not be the same as
originally derived.
.IP \(bu 2
Use 64\-bit integers throughout, to fix memory addressing with large
arrays
(#122 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:kbarbary/\:sep/\:issues/\:122>,
inspired by Gabe Brammer\(aqs fork \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:gbrammer/\:sep>
with additional fixes).
.UNINDENT
.SS Original Changelog
.sp
This is the original changelog from kbarbary/sep \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:kbarbary/\:sep>,
copied here for posterity.
.SS v1.2.1 (1 June 2022)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Same as v1.2.0 but with new wheels for Python 3.10 and AArch64.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.2.0 (1 May 2021)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Changed \fBnumpy.float\fP and \fBnumpy.int\fP types for deprecations in numpy 1.20 (#96).
.IP \(bu 2
Make it possible to safely invoke C library from multiple threads on
independent inputs.
.sp
Global config functions such as \fBset_sub_object_limit()\fP
and \fBset_extract_pixstack()\fP still configure global params
(once for all threads), while other functions will retain their data
in thread\-local storages, so they can be invoked from multiple threads as
long as they work on independent structures.
.sp
Library compilation will now require a C11 compatible compiler, which should
be nowadays available on all supported platforms.
.IP \(bu 2
Mark some pointer parameters with \fBconst *\fP\&. This is a backward\-compatible
change, but makes it easier to extract constants that can be safely shared
between multiple threads and/or invocations.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.1.1 (6 January 2021)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Same as v1.1.0 but with wheels built and uploaded to PyPI. Please report if you
have problems with wheels.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.1.0 (3 January 2021)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Add segmentation masking to the photometry and kron/auto functions (#69).
.IP \(bu 2
Add functions \fBsep.set_sub_object_limit(limit)\fP and \fBsep.get_sub_object_limit()\fP
for modifying and retrieving the sub\-object deblending limit. Previously this
parameter was hard\-coded to 1024. 1024 is now the default value.
.IP \(bu 2
This and future versions are now Python 3 only. Python 2 is no longer
supported.
.IP \(bu 2
Modernize setup.py with pyproject.toml
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.0.3 (12 June 2018)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix double\-free bug in sep_extract() arising when an error status occurs
and convolution is on. (#56)
.IP \(bu 2
Work around numpy dependency in setup. (#59)
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.0.2 (19 September 2017)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix makefile so that \fBmake install\fP works on OS X for the C library.
Python module and C code are unchanged.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.0.1 (10 July 2017)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug when using masked filter and noise array where objects with member
pixels at end of image (maximum y coordinate) were erroneously missed.
.UNINDENT
.SS v1.0.0 (30 September 2016)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Remove features deprecated in previous versions.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug in Background.rms() giving nonsensical results.
.UNINDENT
.SS v0.6.0 (25 August 2016)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
New, more coherent C API. This change should be transparent to users
of the Python module.
.IP \(bu 2
Add variance uncertainty parameters \fBerrx2\fP, \fBerry2\fP and \fBerrxy\fP to
output of \fBsep.extract()\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Add a minimum sigma to \fBsep.winpos()\fP to match Source Extractor
behavior.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix use of boolean masks in \fBsep.kron_radius()\fP\&. Formerly, using a
boolean mask resulted in nonsense results.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix segfault in \fBBackground.back()\fP when box size is same as image size.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug in creating long error messages on Python 3.
.UNINDENT
.SS v0.5.2 (4 January 2016)
.sp
Adds OS X and Windows support.
.SS v0.5.1 (30 November 2015)
.sp
Bugfix release for problem in setup.py in packaged code.
.SS v0.5.0 (22 November 2015)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsep.extract()\fP now uses a more correct matched filter algorithm in the
presence of a noise array, rather than simple convolution. The \fBconv\fP
keyword has been changed to \fBfilter_kernel\fP to reflect this, and a
\fBfilter_type\fP keyword has been added to allow selecting the old behavior
of simple convolution.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsep.extract()\fP now accepts a \fBmask\fP keyword argument.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsep.extract()\fP can now return a segmentation map.
.IP \(bu 2
Special methods added to allow \fBdata \- bkg\fP and \fBnp.array(bkg)\fP where
\fBbkg\fP is a Background object.
.UNINDENT
.SS v0.4.1 (10 November 2015)
.sp
Bugfix release, fixing error estimate in \fBsep.sum_circle\fP and
\fBsep.sum_ellipse\fP when \fBbkgann\fP keyword argument is given.
.SS v0.4.0 (1 June 2015)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
New \fBsep.winpos()\fP function.
.UNINDENT
.SS v0.3.0 (23 February 2015)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
New \fBsep.flux_radius()\fP function.
.UNINDENT
.SS v0.2.0 (13 December 2014)
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fB[breaking change]\fP \fBtheta\fP field in \fBextract()\fP output is now in
radians rather than degrees, for compatibility with new ellipse
aperture functions.
.IP \(bu 2
\fB[deprecation]\fP Change \fBmask_ellipse()\fP parameters from ellipse
coefficients to ellipse axes and position angle, to match aperture
functions. (Old behavior still works as well.)
.IP \(bu 2
\fB[deprecation]\fP Change \fBapercirc()\fP to \fBsum_circle()\fP, to match
new aperture functions. (Old name, \fBapercirc()\fP, still works.)
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBsum_circann()\fP, \fBsum_ellipse()\fP, \fBsum_ellipann()\fP,
\fBkron_radius()\fP, \fBellipse_coeffs()\fP, \fBellipse_axes()\fP functions.
.IP \(bu 2
Exact mode aperture photometery in all functions, with \fBsubpix=0\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Enable variable thresholding in \fBsep.extract\fP\&. [#11]
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug in background masking. This bug impacted masking in all
functions that used masking. Also affected C library.
.IP \(bu 2
More detail in error messages coming from within the C library.
More helpful error message for non\-native byteorder arrays.
.IP \(bu 2
Add ability to change pixel stack size used in \fBextract()\fP, with
\fBset_extract_pixstack()\fP function
